<title>USA: Campbell Cty PPC, Ky., won by Nike Securities.</title>
<headline>Campbell Cty PPC, Ky., won by Nike Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nike Securities said it won $3.960 million of Campbell Cty Public Properties Corp., Ky., first mortgage refunding and improvement revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.987 percent.</p>
</text>
